      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "OpenSSL sits in the image as a Debian base package; the Vulnlog binary links only libc and libz, so libssl is never loaded. Vulnlog is an offline CLI that reads and writes local files, opens no sockets, and therefore runs no QUIC listener that an attacker could flood with Initial packets.",
      "supplier": "Vulnlog"
